    	<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-8 col-md-6 col-lg-6">
        	<div class="cz_24 cz_upper cz_bold">ABOUT us</div>
            <div class="odstep_15"></div>
            <div class="cz_20 cz_bold">We are commited to helping clients</div>
            <div class="odstep_15"></div>
            <div class="cz_siwa">
            	<p>We are a Structural Engineering and Naval Architecture based Consultancy, operating in the Oil &amp; Gas and Renewable industries. <br />
<br />
The company was founded in 2016 during the worst oil crash in a generation to service the needs of marine and subsea installation contractors as an option to supply engineering in the challenging times. To this day we still aim to provide companies with a cost effective and smart Engineering services.</p>            </div>
            <div class="odstep_50"></div>
            <div class="ik_l">
            	<img src="images/ik1.jpg" />
            </div>
            <div class="ik_p">
            	<span class="cz_20 cz_bold cz_upper">Customer focus</span>
                <div class="odstep_15"></div>
                <div class="cz_siwa">
                    <p>We enable our clients to focus on their core business whilst we focus on delivering a cost effective fit-for-purpose solution to their problem.<br />
<br />
Through being reactive, flexible and transparent we deliver results and thereby build trusted client relationships.<br />
<br />
Safety of personnel and the environment are and will remain the over-riding highest priority.</p>                </div>                
            </div>
            <div class="odstep_30"></div>
            <div class="ik_l">
            	<img src="images/ik2.jpg" />
            </div>
            <div class="ik_p">
            	<span class="cz_20 cz_bold cz_upper">Corporate Social Responsibility</span>
                <div class="odstep_15"></div>
                <div class="cz_siwa">
                    <p>We listen to understand our client’s interests, concerns and culture.<br />
<br />
We have a positive attitude that is open, honest, fair and respectful to colleagues, customers, the community and the environment.<br />
<br />
Our ethically oriented practices reduce our clients' business and legal risk to a minimum.</p>                </div>                
            </div>  
            <div class="odstep_30"></div>
            <div class="ik_l">
            	<img src="images/ik3.jpg" />
            </div>
            <div class="ik_p">
            	<span class="cz_20 cz_bold cz_upper">Reduced cost</span>
                <div class="odstep_15"></div>
                <div class="cz_siwa">
                    <p>Our sound knowledge of industry standards, equipment, codes and specifications, existing procedures, methodology and safe systems of work allows us to provide our clients with cost effective solutions.<br />
<br />
Our well skilled and experienced engineers and designers work on a freelance basis, which additionally lowers the cost of our services.</p>                </div>                
            </div>
